# libubootenv (fw_printenv/fw_setenv) configuration for the eicke A/B scheme:
# the U-Boot environment lives as a plain file on the FAT boot partition,
# mounted at /boot (LABEL=esp, see the image fstab). The env size must match
# CONFIG_ENV_SIZE in u-boot's eicke-env-fat.cfg and mkenvimage in ubootenv.bb.
#
# Device/file path      offset    env size
/boot/uboot.env         0x0000    0x10000
